classDiagram
    note for PowerCache "internal/cache 只管理 Skill 与 Agent：复验 cache hit，miss 时创建唯一私有目标，经 Source 下载和 marker 复验后按精确版本原子发布，再原子物化公共 staging"
    class CacheSource {
        <<interface: internal/cache.Source>>
        +DownloadSkill(Context, PowerRef, destination) error
        +DownloadAgent(Context, PowerRef, destination) error
    }
    class PowerCache {
        <<interface: internal/cache.PowerCache>>
        +PrepareSkill(Context, PowerRef) (stagingRoot string, error)
        +PrepareAgent(Context, PowerRef) (stagingRoot string, error)
    }
    class FilesystemCache {
        <<internal/cache.FilesystemCache>>
        +PrepareSkill(Context, PowerRef) (stagingRoot string, error)
        +PrepareAgent(Context, PowerRef) (stagingRoot string, error)
    }
    class CloudClient {
        <<internal/cloud.Client>>
    }
    class VersionedPowerCache {
        <<cache/skills or cache/agents/name/version>>
    }
    class PublicStaging {
        <<staging/skills or staging/agents/name>>
    }

    FilesystemCache ..|> PowerCache
    FilesystemCache --> CacheSource : injected source
    CloudClient ..|> CacheSource
    FilesystemCache --> VersionedPowerCache : validate and publish immutable version
    FilesystemCache --> PublicStaging : atomically replace candidate

    class PluginResource {
        <<internal/pluginresource>>
        +Ensure(Context, PowerRef) (Artifact, error)
        +Lookup(PowerRef) (Artifact, error)
        +StageFilesystem(PowerRef) (stagingRoot string, error)
    }
    class PluginArtifactValidator {
        <<internal/pluginartifact>>
    }
    class PluginArtifactCache {
        <<cache/plugins/name/version>>
    }

    PluginResource --> CloudClient : DownloadPlugin canonical package
    PluginResource --> PluginArtifactValidator : parse apc-plugin and validate derived files
    PluginResource --> PluginArtifactCache : publish shared immutable artifact
    note for PluginArtifactCache "Plugin cache 不属于 PowerCache；Plugin Resource 保留 apc-plugin.json + skills，先生成 Codex/Claude/Hermes 原生 manifest，再由 marketplace builder 读取对应 manifest 生成双 marketplace（ADR-017）"
